=== Acceptance Criteria ===
  [x] Surface renders on Android with all states from the web source reproduced (loading / empty / error / stale / offline + content), UiState-driven like the sibling SpeedTrendChart.
  [x] No data feed bound in the view (web component is presentational: props heatmap + peakCostPerKwh); only the shared S8 settings store is read for the currency symbol (web useFormatting). No direct HTTP.
  [x] Every i18n key from source resolves through the P1/S10 catalog: charging.optimizer.heatmap / .cheap / .expensive (+ reused translation_sessions, translation_charging_detail_perKwh, translation_chart_noData, freshness keys). Weekday labels localize via DateFormatSymbols (no hardcoded English).
  [x] Accessibility: busy cells carry localized TalkBack labels (native analogue of the web cell title), empty cells stay decorative, loading is announced, retry control labeled; font scale + reduce-motion (FadeIn) respected.
  [x] Tests: adapter unit test (CostHeatmapProjectionTest, 24 cases) + diagnostics unit test (3 cases) run in the gate; per-state + a11y-label UI test (CostHeatmapUiTest, androidTest) authored. The a11y label logic is additionally covered off-device in the projection test.
  [x] No TODO/stub/mock/placeholder/Lorem in shipped code.

NOTE on androidTest: the canonical ':android:' gate (assembleRelease + testReleaseUnitTest + ktlintCheck + detekt + check-placeholders) does not compile the instrumented androidTest source set. CostHeatmapUiTest compiles clean in isolation (zero errors attributed to it). A pre-existing, unrelated latent issue in 9 sibling androidTest files (they `import` the member functions assertExists/assertDoesNotExist) breaks a full androidTest compile; those files are outside this surface's allowed-files scope and were not modified. CostHeatmapUiTest uses the correct member-call style (matching the working WeekOverWeekSummaryUiTest).

